      "source": "<template>\n  <p class=\"slds-var-m-bottom_small slds-text-body_regular\">\n    Download the sample file, then import it. Row 4 has an unreadable employee count, so it comes\n    back in a file of rows to fix while the other rows import.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"slds-var-m-bottom_medium\">\n    <lightning-button\n      label=\"Download sample CSV\"\n      icon-name=\"utility:download\"\n      onclick={handleDownloadSample}\n    ></lightning-button>\n  </div>\n  <!-- saveFile downloads through an anchor in this template, which works under Lightning Web Security. -->\n  <a class=\"sample-download slds-hide\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</a>\n\n  <c-data-import\n    template-name=\"Example_Accounts\"\n    label=\"Import accounts\"\n    onimported={handleImported}\n  ></c-data-import>\n\n  <template lwc:if={result}>\n    <p class=\"slds-var-m-top_small slds-text-body_small\">\n      {result.status}: {result.committed} saved, {result.failed} to fix\n    </p>\n  </template>\n</template>"
